sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant API as REST API
    participant Idem as Idempotency Module
    participant Booking as Booking Use Case
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Inventory as Inventory Repository
    participant Voucher as Voucher Repository

    Customer->>API: POST /bookings + Idempotency-Key
    API->>API: Parse, authenticate, validate DTO
    API->>Idem: Compute request fingerprint
    Idem->>DB: Lookup (user_id, key)

    alt Existing key, same fingerprint and completed
        DB-->>Idem: Stored response
        Idem-->>API: Replay original status/body
        API-->>Customer: Original response
    else Existing key with different fingerprint
        DB-->>Idem: Conflicting fingerprint
        Idem-->>API: IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
        API-->>Customer: 409 Conflict
    else New logical request
        Booking->>DB: BEGIN
        Booking->>Idem: Insert idempotency record (unique scope/key)
        Idem-->>Booking: Claim succeeds
        Booking->>DB: Validate published/bookable concert
        Booking->>Inventory: Reserve categories in sorted order
        Inventory->>DB: Conditional UPDATE ... WHERE available >= qty

        alt Sold out
            DB-->>Inventory: 0 rows
            Booking->>DB: ROLLBACK
            Booking-->>API: INVENTORY_EXHAUSTED
            API-->>Customer: 409 Conflict
        else Voucher supplied
            Booking->>Voucher: Reserve eligibility and quota
            Voucher->>DB: Conditional quota update + redemption insert
            alt Voucher rejected
                DB-->>Voucher: Ineligible/exhausted
                Booking->>DB: ROLLBACK inventory and idempotency claim
                Booking-->>API: VOUCHER_INVALID
                API-->>Customer: 422 Unprocessable Entity
            else Voucher accepted
                Voucher-->>Booking: Discount snapshot
            end
        end

        Booking->>DB: Insert booking/items and price snapshots
        Booking->>Idem: Store response payload
        Booking->>DB: COMMIT
        Booking-->>API: Booking response
        API-->>Customer: 201 Created
    end

    Note over API,DB: No external network call is made inside the critical transaction.
